<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίταξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>injunction,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐ. τοῦ φόρου</span> the
				<i>assessment</i> of the tribute, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.89
			</span></i> : pl., <i>assessments,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				97
			</span></i> : <i>a command, order,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				834d
			</span></i> (pl.) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν τῆς αὑτοῦ ψυχῆς
				ἐ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				687c
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὰν ἐ. τῶ Ἀπόλλωνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Abh.Berl.Akad.</u>
					1925(5).21
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>command,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρχοντος ἔργον ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1326b14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1325a26
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐπίταξιν</span>”
				<i>imperatively,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1457a22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in Tactics,
				<i>station on the flanks,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόταξις, ὑπόταξις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				10.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				24.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
